	(text "2026-08-22: yaw channel FITTED (user decision, supersedes the 'reserved only' note above): EN_yaw PA9 (TIM1_CH2), PH_yaw PB12, IPROPI_yaw PC4 (ADC1_IN14) per vault; PROVISIONAL nFAULT_yaw PC12, RC_OUT_yaw PB13 (EXTI only - no free capture channel; use I2C RC_CNT or EXTI)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30 190 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
		)
		(uuid "5c501740-8283-4eaf-a304-d0eb5820cd84")
	)
	(text "MCU - STM32F411RET6 LQFP64. Implements: COL-COTS-0024. Pin map: vault Main-Board-01 MCU Pinout (EN on TIM3, IPROPI on ADC1 E/S edges, ENC on TIM2/TIM1 capture). Layout: docs/design/parts/STM32F411.md. Yaw reserved pins PA9/PB12/PC4 left unconnected per vault. PROVISIONAL (owed to vault): I2C1 on PB8/PB9, DRV_nSLEEP on PC5, nFAULT on PC0-2/PC10, RC_OUT on PB6/PB7/PA10/PA11."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30 25 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
		)
		(uuid "a8d7039f-35a9-4c44-8c5c-3afa369bd0ad")
	)
